      "6bc3e996-eb39-4d52-9294-15cdd7d10f92": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "content": "Tests the creation, editing and deletion of networks and the nodes inside it.\n- Create three devices: 1 Device, 1 Router and 1 Gateway. The default icon for the Device and Router should be a router,\nbut it should a host (computer) for the Gateway.\n- Create links between them, including Ethernet Link and Link.\n- Edit the name of a node and the name of a link: the name must be instantly\nupdated.\n- Edit the name of the network and refresh: check that the positions are the same (the \"update\" position of the Network class is replacing old with new positions).\n- Delete a device: check that the two connected links are also deleted from the network.\n Check that these objects still exist in the inventory: deleting from a network should not delete the original objects.\n- Use the right-click multiple selection rectangle to delete the remaining objects.\n- Delete the network itself from the Network table.",
        "positions": [
          227,
          -507
        ]
      }
    },
